==Battleground==
*5 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 11.67 seconds<sup>350f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 21.67 seconds<sup>650f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

